## Decision Record: `subgraph-readmes.ts` wording contract

`subgraph-readmes.ts` lives in the upstream `bootstrap-tools` submodule. Its marker banner (`Generated by the bootstrap toolset (...) — do not edit; ...` / `Do not edit it here; ...`) is defined in `bootstrap-tools/scripts/generated-by.ts` and mandated by owner rulings `xsqm` and #1770. In `check-docs-populated.ts`, `GENERATED_MARKERS` is scoped to whole-page generator markers (`Do not hand-edit`, `— do not edit here.`, and `var SCOPE =`). Widening `GENERATED_MARKERS` to classify `subgraph-readmes.ts` output as generated would cause `folio-assistant` (the repository root instance) to fail `check:docs-populated`, because `docs/` is an empty overlay (`root-docs`) holding only `docs/README.md` (which holds no files by design, verified by `compose-docs.test.ts: an EMPTY overlay composes byte-identically`). Therefore, the contract is preserved: `gen-iris-pages.ts` adopts the platform `Do not hand-edit` contract, while `subgraph-readmes.ts` keeps its submodule contract without falsely breaking empty overlays.

